{"id":"wb-5-163","name":"临安吴越国王陵","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"吴越国王陵","text":"吴越国王陵位于浙江省杭州市，是五代十国时期吴越国的王家陵墓。陵墓包括吴越国第一代国王钱镠墓、吴越国第二代国王的王后马氏墓康陵，及钱缪的父母钱宽、水邱氏墓。2001年被列入全国重点文物保护单位，名称为临安吴越国王陵。2006年，吴汉月墓归入，名称定为吴越国王陵。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%90%B4%E8%B6%8A%E5%9B%BD%E7%8E%8B%E9%99%B5","revisionId":94082350,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94082350","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与所在地一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/7bbf9ed015defa4d6c892a79.jpg","title":"20240110_Mausoleum_of_Qian_Liu_(121652).jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20240110_Mausoleum_of_Qian_Liu_(121652).jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/14/20240110_Mausoleum_of_Qian_Liu_%28121652%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Yumeto","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"Mausoleum of Qian Liu","width":320,"height":240}}